---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Form from '../components/Form.astro';
---
<Base title="Software and automation" description="iBIM uses software and automation in its BIM and architectural work, builds custom dashboards and reporting, and is investing in a digital twin platform.">
  <section class="wrap contact">
    <div class="contact__intro">
      <h1>Software and automation for the built environment</h1>
      <p class="lead">We’re software and automation specialists working across BIM and architectural projects, so routine work takes less time and your project information is easier to use.</p>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        <li>Automation in 3D modelling, turning captured data into reliable models</li>
        <li>Custom dashboards and reporting for project information</li>
        <li>A digital twin platform we’re investing in, connecting BIM workflows to facilities management using AI</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Tell us about a process that takes too long, or join the waiting list to hear about the platform first.</p>
      <a class="textlink" href="/contact">Talk to us about automation</a>
    </div>
    <div class="contact__form">
      <h2>Join the platform waiting list</h2>
      <Form kind="waitlist" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
